// RUNNING THE APP
// ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

// Prerequisites:
// - Node.js >= 18.0.0
// - MongoDB (local or Atlas)
// - Stripe API keys
// - SMTP email credentials

// Setup Backend:
// cd backend
// npm install
// cp .env.example .env        (configure your environment variables)
// npm run dev                 (development mode with nodemon)
// npm test                    (run 44 test cases)

// Run Tests:
// npm test                    (Mocha - 44 tests, ~3-5 seconds)
// npx mocha tests/auth.test.js  (run specific test file)
// npm run test:watch          (watch mode)

// Build Frontend:
// cd frontend
// npm install
// npm run build               (minified output to dist/)
// npm run watch               (watch mode)

// ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
// API ENDPOINTS
// ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

// Auth API (/api/auth)
// POST   /signup              - Create account
// POST   /login               - Login user
// POST   /refresh-token       - Refresh JWT
// GET    /me                  - Get current user
// POST   /profile             - Update profile
// POST   /change-password     - Change password
// POST   /delete-account      - Delete account
// POST   /verify-email        - Verify email
// POST   /forgot-password     - Request password reset
// POST   /reset-password      - Reset password

// Matching API (/api/matches)
// GET    /potential           - Get potential matches
// POST   /like                - Like a user
// POST   /pass                - Pass on a user
// GET    /matches             - Get mutual matches
// GET    /count               - Get match count

// Chat API (/api/chat)
// POST   /message             - Send message
// GET    /:matchId            - Get conversation
// GET    /conversations       - Get all conversations
// POST   /read                - Mark messages as read

// Media API (/api/media)
// POST   /upload              - Upload file
// GET    /my-files            - List user files
// DELETE /:mediaId            - Delete file

// Moments API (/api/moments)
// POST   /create              - Create moment
// GET    /:userId             - Get user moments
// POST   /:momentId/like      - Like moment
// POST   /:momentId/comment   - Comment on moment

// And 19+ more API endpoint groups

